f multiple cells, while also returning data on individual membrane protrusion events. The plug-in accepts as input one or two image stacks and outputs a variety of data. ADAPT may also be run in batch mode.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>ADAPT is capable of rapid, automated analysis of migration and membrane protrusions, together with associated<br />\r\nfluorescently labeled proteins, across multiple cells. ADAPT can detect and morphologically profile filopodia.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ADAPT (Automated Detection and Analysis of ProTrusions) is a plug-in developed for the <a href=\"http://fiji.sc/Fiji\">ImageJ/Fiji</a> platform to automatically detect and analyse cell migration and morphodynamics. The program provides whole-cell analysis of multiple cells, while also returning data on individual membrane protrusion events. The plug-in accepts as input one or two image stacks and outputs a variety of data. ADAPT may also be run in batch mode.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-29T21:23:03+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-15T10:18:00+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":3580,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"5e6102a9-fa32-4a89-9acd-d1e675ffbdda","url":"/taxonomy/term/3580"},{"target_id":3582,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"9a551b99-5357-4b8b-a77a-ac7f1da3ed48","url":"/taxonomy/term/3582"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1487155482,"last_comment_uid":42,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Dave Barry"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5039,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"9602b8eb-f48f-4f4e-8f3d-dcfaf8b45fa7","url":"/taxonomy/term/5039"},{"target_id":4374,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"565afd65-a72c-42c4-9a7d-634f5fc14680","url":"/taxonomy/term/4374"},{"target_id":5087